[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11820.469, "timestamp": "03:17:00", "text": "人才经纪人，呃，不是人才经理人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11823.83, "timestamp": "03:17:03", "text": "呃，你的私人经理或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11826.87, "timestamp": "03:17:06", "text": "为这次活动准备一些东西，他们会……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11829.19, "timestamp": "03:17:09", "text": "告诉你，就像你知道的，呃，加入这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11831.91, "timestamp": "03:17:11", "text": "群组 VC 或这次通话或谷歌搜索我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11834.469, "timestamp": "03:17:14", "text": "那个东西可以在你家完成，他们会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11837.349, "timestamp": "03:17:17", "text": "我们有一些工作人员为您服务"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11839.51, "timestamp": "03:17:19", "text": "他们会处理电视机器人之类的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11842.15, "timestamp": "03:17:22", "text": "对，你可以像这样进行见面会。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11846.229, "timestamp": "03:17:26", "text": "因出名而被选中"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11847.83, "timestamp": "03:17:27", "text": "你必须非常幸运或者像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11852.309, "timestamp": "03:17:32", "text": "是的，他真的很有名。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11856.07, "timestamp": "03:17:36", "text": "我觉得每个人都会申请，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11860.95, "timestamp": "03:17:40", "text": "铃木也尝试过申请"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11863.349, "timestamp": "03:17:43", "text": "对，铃木。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11865.59, "timestamp": "03:17:45", "text": "她试着申请过，我不知道她是否申请过。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11870.87, "timestamp": "03:17:50", "text": "她明白了，但她的观点之一是扎克的观点"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11873.67, "timestamp": "03:17:53", "text": "作为一名在 Offkai 工作的人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11876.95, "timestamp": "03:17:56", "text": "去年的博览会之类的。啊"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11878.71, "timestamp": "03:17:58", "text": "是啊是啊"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 11879.841, "timestamp": "03:17:59", "author": "@PanditJi.Y", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/dbuBEqO3mJ9DX4Uu_LhA4jdzC_POgn5GfeMyztO06j5c73okFxwnXUaKWurMIj0mYXB_y53S_Q=s64